WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.756
So, you've cleared every skill for a Track Badge.

00:00:04.756 --> 00:00:07.385
Now there's just one step left:

00:00:07.385 --> 00:00:08.827
a live interview.

00:00:08.827 --> 00:00:09.929
And honestly?

00:00:09.929 --> 00:00:11.880
It should be this easy.

00:00:12.886 --> 00:00:16.541
The moment you're eligible, your dashboard tells you.

00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:18.335
Pick a day, pick a time...

00:00:18.335 --> 00:00:19.576
and you're booked.

00:00:20.633 --> 00:00:23.276
From here, one card shows you everything.

00:00:23.276 --> 00:00:27.273
When it is, who you're meeting, and what you can still change.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.233
Interviewers get a simple schedule for the day.

00:00:31.233 --> 00:00:34.500
And the buttons only unlock when it's actually time.

00:00:35.505 --> 00:00:38.210
They record the result, with real feedback.

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:41.355
Pass, and the badge is on your profile right away.

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:47.927
Meanwhile, the interview team can see who's booked, who hasn't, and nudge them in one click.

00:00:48.937 --> 00:00:57.247
And when something goes wrong, like an emergency, a dispute, or even cheating, there's a clear and fair way to handle it.

00:00:58.251 --> 00:00:59.332
GRIT Interviews.

00:00:59.332 --> 00:01:01.021
From eligible, to earned.
